- Splits on any whitespace (spaces, tabs, newlines)
- Automatically removes empty strings
- Handles leading/trailing whitespace properly

**Verification:**
All test cases now pass:
- `count_words('a b c')` returns 3 ✓
- `count_words('  hello   world ')` returns 2 ✓  
- `count_words('')` returns 0 ✓

